			<div class="container">
				<nav role="navigation" aria-label="Breadcrumbs" class="breadcrumb-trail breadcrumbs" itemprop="breadcrumb"><ul class="trail-items" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/BreadcrumbList"><meta name="numberOfItems" content="4" /><meta name="itemListOrder" content="Ascending" /><li itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem" class="trail-item trail-begin"><a href="https://www.ssc.edu/" rel="home" itemprop="item"><span itemprop="name">Home</span></a><meta itemprop="position" content="1" /></li><li itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem" class="trail-item"><a href="https://www.ssc.edu/athletics/" itemprop="item"><span itemprop="name">Athletics</span></a><meta itemprop="position" content="2" /></li><li itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem" class="trail-item"><a href="https://www.ssc.edu/athletics/baseball/" itemprop="item"><span itemprop="name">Baseball</span></a><meta itemprop="position" content="3" /></li><li itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem" class="trail-item trail-end"><a id="BreadcrumbDisableLink" itemprop="item"><span itemprop="name">Baseball Alumni</span></a><meta itemprop="position" content="4" /></li></ul></nav>			</div>
			
	
			<article id="post-8440" class="post-8440 page type-page status-publish hentry">
				
				<div class="container">
					<header class="athletics-header">
						<h1 class="athletics-title"><span></span>Baseball Alumni</h1>
					</header>
					
					
				
									
					<div class="">
						<div class="row">
															<div class="col-md-9">
												
														
							</div>
							
															
	<div class="col-md-3 hidden-print" id="sidebar-right">


	
		

	

	
		
	
		
</div>													</div>
					</div>
				</div>
					

					
									
	
					
								
								
					<div class="container">
						<p>South Suburban College’s student athletes’ graduation rate under Head Coach Steve Rucich is 75%. Steve has coached eleven All-Americans including 2013 1st team Steve Letz and 2006 1st team Lee Fischer who was also voted best defensive player in the nation. “Coach Ru” also has had <span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">25</span> players drafted by major league teams including six players that have reached the big leagues. 210 players have continued on to four-year college programs. As a player himself, Steve was named second team All-American Catcher, All-District Catcher and All-Area Catcher.</p>
<p>Below is the list of Bulldogs who have moved on to four year schools or successful transfer:</p>
